<section class="lesson-section"><h3>Takeaway</h3><p>People are part of the defense when systems make safe actions easy and reporting safe. Project evidence is not submitted to or persisted by this platform.</p></section>' WHERE id IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'bebb003b-dd29-49cb-9aa8-226951647a6a' AND module_id IS NOT DISTINCT FROM '79625752-2530-43f5-b19d-3416a1d43625' AND title IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'Security Awareness and Training' AND content IS NOT DISTINCT FROM 'Regular training to help employees recognize and avoid security threats.';
